{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EQuAo1So9hbXA4nYbewd3V","type":"tool_result","content":"| HTTP service (Fastify) | `src/server.ts` | `/v1/sms/inbound` webhook, `/v1/chat` web chat |\n| Agent loop | `src/agent/loop.ts` | Claude Sonnet 4.5 snapshot, tool use |\n| Intent classifier | `src/agent/classifier.ts` | Claude Haiku 4.5 snapshot, routes emergencies and complaints to staff |\n| Tool registry | `src/tools/registry.ts` | EHR MCP server plus native tools, scanned on load |\n| Tool executor | `src/tools/executor.ts` | allowlist, kill switch, budgets, approvals, audit |\n| EHR | `src/integrations/ehr-mcp.ts` | MCP over streamable HTTP with mTLS, per-clinic OAuth client |\n| Payments | `src/integrations/payments.ts` | deposit refunds, provider idempotency keys |\n| SMS | `src/integrations/sms.ts` | outbound reminders and replies |\n| Eligibility peer | `src/integrations/eligibility-a2a.ts` | A2A `message/send`, token exchange per call |\n| Reminder job | `src/workers/reminders.ts` | Kubernetes CronJob, 17:00 local each day |\n\nThere is no vector store and no conversation memory. Every run starts from the patient's message and\nthe EHR. Conversation transcripts are not stored by this service.\n\n## High-impact actions\n\n`config/policy.yaml` lists the tools that need a staff approval before they run. The agent asks for\nthe approval, a front-desk lead or clinic manager approves it in the staff console, and the agent\nretries with the approval ID. Approvals expire after 15 minutes.\n\n## Stopping the agent\n\nOperators with the `clinic-agent-ops` role set `halted = true` on the `global` item (all clinics) or a\n`tenant#<clinicId>` item in the `clinic-agent-control` DynamoDB table:\n\n```bash\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"awsRole\": \"arn:aws:iam::418295730611:role/clinic-agent-runtime\",\n    \"ehrScopes\": [\"patient.read\", \"appointment.read\", \"appointment.write\"],\n    \"paymentsScopes\": [\"deposits.refund\"],\n    \"eligibilityScopes\": [\"eligibility:read\"]\n  },\n  \"memory\": \"none\",\n  \"retrieval\": \"none\",\n  \"network\": { \"policy\": \"k8s/deployment.yaml#clinic-agent-egress\", \"egressProxy\": \"egress-proxy.platform.svc:3128\" },\n  \"budgets\": \"config/budgets.yaml\",\n  \"policies\": { \"action\": \"config/policy.yaml\", \"actionPolicyVersion\": \"2026-09-18.3\" }\n}\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:7:  backend \"s3\" {\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:133:# Audit: Firehose to an S3 bucket with object lock in compliance mode (7 years, HIPAA retention).\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:134:resource \"aws_s3_bucket\" \"audit\" {\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:139:resource \"aws_s3_bucket_object_lock_configuration\" \"audit\" {\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:140:  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.audit.id\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:151:  destination = \"extended_s3\"\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:152:  extended_s3_configuration {\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:154:    bucket_arn          = aws_s3_bucket.audit.arn\ninfra/terraform/iam.tf:103:      Action   = [\"s3:PutObject\", \"s3:AbortMultipartUpload\", \"s3:GetBucketLocation\"]\ninfra/terraform/iam.tf:104:      Resource = [aws_s3_bucket.audit.arn, \"${aws_s3_bucket.audit.arn}/*\"]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"03bf42c4-8e10-453a-88ac-bafba77a3b9b","uuid":"047208d7-35a0-4aaf-98f6-82b8b4e33446","timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:24:49.937Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"| HTTP service (Fastify) | `src/server.ts` | `/v1/sms/inbound` webhook, `/v1/chat` web chat |\n| Agent loop | `src/agent/loop.ts` | Claude Sonnet 4.5 snapshot, tool use |\n| Intent classifier | `src/agent/classifier.ts` | Claude Haiku 4.5 snapshot, routes emergencies and complaints to staff |\n| Tool registry | `src/tools/registry.ts` | EHR MCP server plus native tools, scanned on load |\n| Tool executor | `src/tools/executor.ts` | allowlist, kill switch, budgets, approvals, audit |\n| EHR | `src/integrations/ehr-mcp.ts` | MCP over streamable HTTP with mTLS, per-clinic OAuth client |\n| Payments | `src/integrations/payments.ts` | deposit refunds, provider idempotency keys |\n| SMS | `src/integrations/sms.ts` | outbound reminders and replies |\n| Eligibility peer | `src/integrations/eligibility-a2a.ts` | A2A `message/send`, token exchange per call |\n| Reminder job | `src/workers/reminders.ts` | Kubernetes CronJob, 17:00 local each day |\n\nThere is no vector store and no conversation memory. Every run starts from the patient's message and\nthe EHR. Conversation transcripts are not stored by this service.\n\n## High-impact actions\n\n`config/policy.yaml` lists the tools that need a staff approval before they run. The agent asks for\nthe approval, a front-desk lead or clinic manager approves it in the staff console, and the agent\nretries with the approval ID. Approvals expire after 15 minutes.\n\n## Stopping the agent\n\nOperators with the `clinic-agent-ops` role set `halted = true` on the `global` item (all clinics) or a\n`tenant#<clinicId>` item in the `clinic-agent-control` DynamoDB table:\n\n```bash\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"awsRole\": \"arn:aws:iam::418295730611:role/clinic-agent-runtime\",\n    \"ehrScopes\": [\"patient.read\", \"appointment.read\", \"appointment.write\"],\n    \"paymentsScopes\": [\"deposits.refund\"],\n    \"eligibilityScopes\": [\"eligibility:read\"]\n  },\n  \"memory\": \"none\",\n  \"retrieval\": \"none\",\n  \"network\": { \"policy\": \"k8s/deployment.yaml#clinic-agent-egress\", \"egressProxy\": \"egress-proxy.platform.svc:3128\" },\n  \"budgets\": \"config/budgets.yaml\",\n  \"policies\": { \"action\": \"config/policy.yaml\", \"actionPolicyVersion\": \"2026-09-18.3\" }\n}\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:7:  backend \"s3\" {\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:133:# Audit: Firehose to an S3 bucket with object lock in compliance mode (7 years, HIPAA retention).\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:134:resource \"aws_s3_bucket\" \"audit\" {\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:139:resource \"aws_s3_bucket_object_lock_configuration\" \"audit\" {\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:140:  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.audit.id\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:151:  destination = \"extended_s3\"\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:152:  extended_s3_configuration {\ninfra/terraform/main.tf:154:    bucket_arn          = aws_s3_bucket.audit.arn\ninfra/terraform/iam.tf:103:      Action   = [\"s3:PutObject\", \"s3:AbortMultipartUpload\", \"s3:GetBucketLocation\"]\ninfra/terraform/iam.tf:104:      Resource = [aws_s3_bucket.audit.arn, \"${aws_s3_bucket.audit.arn}/*\"]","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EQuAo1So9hbXA4nYbewd3V","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
